	;  DPV3334 (01/06/2009) - Implement support for INSTR Scalar function
	;  DPV3304 (10/29/2008) - Correct checkingto see if method code is a no-op
	;  DPV3245 (08/12/2008) - Shorten andor code generated line to avoid $Compile problem
	;  DPV3221 (07/17/2008) - Correctly return "" for some scalar functions against NULL stream values
	;  DPV3207 (06/25/2008) - Implement support for $LISTBUILD, $LISTFROMSTRING, $LISTTOSTRING scalar functions
	;  DPV3173 (06/09/2008) - Reduce use of %Library.Float, some functions return DOUBLE or NUMERIC
	;  DPV3176 (05/29/2008) - INFORMIX:  MATCHES Support
	;  DPV3170 (05/23/2008) - Perform Normalization on literal and host variable input values
	;  DPV3149 (05/08/2008) - Fix HOUR, MINUTE, SECOND when non-default TimeSeparator used
	;  DPV3131 (03/25/2008) - Fix ddgetf to set cls,prop instead of classname,property
	;                         If IFNULL to not leave qval defined
	;  DPV3211 (03/11/2008) - tag name changes for class compiler performance improvements
	;  JLF204  (03/02/2008) - Added MAXCHAR operator
	;  DPV3099 (02/08/2008) - CAST('somestring' as DATETIME) returns NULL when 'somestring' is not a datetime value
	;  AK668   (12/28/2006) - Group By and ValueList/DisplayList
	;  DPV3085 (12/13/2007) - Pass in stored ID to %Text search methods instead of fully formed Oid for stream fields
